{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09171","headline":"听江笛送陆侍御 · 韦应物","name":"听江笛送陆侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远听江上笛，临觞一送君。\n还愁独宿夜，更向郡斋闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}